  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/01/IMG_8535.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La tarde-noche de este viernes se han entregado los <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=43271\" target=\"_blank\">premios de la campa&ntilde;a de Navidad de Onda Centre Comercial, cuyo sorteo se realiz&oacute; el pasado lunes</a>. Tambi&eacute;n se ha presentado la campa&ntilde;a Enamora&#39;t, que ser&aacute; del 20 de enero al 15 de febrero.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliuramentpremisocccampanyanadal/img_8479.jpg\" alt=\"img_8479\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliuramentpremisocccampanyanadal/img_8480.jpg\" alt=\"img_8480\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliuramentpremisocccampanyanadal/img_8481.jpg\" alt=\"img_8481\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliuramentpremisocccampanyanadal/img_8482.jpg\" alt=\"img_8482\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliuramentpremisocccampanyanadal/img_8483.jpg\" alt=\"img_8483\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliuramentpremisocccampanyanadal/img_8484.jpg\" alt=\"img_8484\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliuramentpremisocccampanyanadal/img_8485.jpg\" alt=\"img_8485\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/lliuramentpremisocccampanyanadal/img_8486.jpg\" alt=\"img_8486\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976